	(text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 runs fujinet-firmware (build fujiversal-astrocade, include/pinmap/fujiversal-astrocade.h).\nIt is the USB HOST of the RP2354A (IO19/IO20, native USB) and re-flashes it over PICOBOOT: IO4 -> RP RUN,\nIO5 -> RP QSPI_SS (1k series each, on the RP sheet), driven LOW to assert, inputs when idle.\nIO26-IO37 belong to the module's flash/PSRAM (N16R8) and stay unconnected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4554483b-7c75-5df7-ae31-00145c4060ca")
	)
	(text "RESET (top face) pulls RP RUN and S3 EN low through a common-cathode BAT54C:\nneither reset line can drive the other.  EN: 10k / 1 uF power-on delay."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4ec696a3-9c25-5bb7-933a-72437b4fb13a")
	)
	(text "S3 BOOT (IO0)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "92bf0413-e173-543d-8300-11a5c3dafde5")
	)
	(text "microSD (SPI).  CD closes to the shell with a card in:\nSD_CD reads LOW = card present."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "222ef10e-af01-59bf-843a-48ead680887a")
	)
	(text "Status LED: WS2812B-2020 on +5V (datasheet VDD 3.7-5.3 V;\nVIH 2.7 V takes the S3's 3.3 V data without a level shifter)."
